# Text files are checked out with LF on every system, Windows too: golden files, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, the embedded
# page and the test fixtures must stay byte for byte as committed. Git finds binary files itself; media is named here
# so it's never mistaken for text.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.ogg binary
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.webm binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
